During that meeting at the day use area, you framed our early interaction a=
s an emotional wound inflicted on you. You were performing, of course =97 a=
nd I knew this even as I apologized to you a second time for something that=
 didn=92t warrant an apology, because
 I was trying to keep the peace.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
